=2E What exactly is meant by overly exposed DNS infrastructure? Descriptive=
 hostnames: making asset and service discovery an elementary task. 4 risks=
 that an organization can face by exposing their infrastructure. Analysis=
 of some existing exposed internet assets using WhoisXML API=E2=80=99s pas=
sive DNS intelligence. Guidelines to mitigate cybersecurity risks of overl=
y descriptive host naming practices. Listen to Podcast (https://soundcloud=
